                         Patch Metadata - Gen 1/50 - Novelty: 1/2 - Resample: 1/3 - Patch: 1/2                          
╭──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ parameter_sharing_sparse_entanglement                                                     │
│ patch_description        │ This evolution reduces the parameter count from 162 to 27 by implementing parameter       │
│                          │ sharing across the 6 block repetitions (3 uploads × 2 repeats). Instead of having         │
│                          │ independent parameters for each block instance, we reuse the same 27 parameter names      │
│                          │ across all blocks, which allows the optimizer to learn a single set of effective          │
│                          │ transformations that are applied repeatedly.                                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Additionally, we optimize the entanglement pattern:                                       │
│                          │ - Keep RY rotations on all 9 qubits (9 params)                                            │
│                          │ - Keep RZ pre-entanglement on all 9 qubits (9 params)                                     │
│                          │ - Use a sparser CZ pattern: only the outer ring (8 edges) plus 4 center connections = 12  │
│                          │ edges (same as before)                                                                    │
│                          │ - Keep RZ post-entanglement on all 9 qubits (9 params)                                    │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The key insight is that parameter sharing leverages the data re-uploading structure: the  │
│                          │ feature map changes at each upload, so the same ansatz block can learn to respond         │
│                          │ differently to different feature inputs. This is more parameter-efficient and often leads │
│                          │ to better generalization.                                                                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The reduced parameter count (27 vs 162) means:                                            │
│                          │ - Fewer parameters to optimize (easier convergence)                                       │
│                          │ - Lower circuit depth per block (since we're not changing the gate structure, just        │
│                          │ sharing params)                                                                           │
│                          │ - Better parameter efficiency score                                                       │
│                          │ - Reduced risk of barren plateaus                                                         │
│ num_applied              │ 2                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0330                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ openrouter/anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5                                                     │
│ temperature              │ 1.0                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ diff_summary             │ added: 0; deleted: 9; modified: 9;                                                        │
