│                          │ at the end of the ansatz block, immediately following the RY_out layer. This follows the  │
│                          │ recommendation to sharpen phase boundaries in the Z-readout basis. By sharing these 9     │
│                          │ gates across just 3 parameters per block, we maintain high parameter efficiency while     │
│                          │ allowing the circuit to better tune the final state phases before measurement. This helps │
│                          │ in carving more precise decision surfaces for the 'cross', 'circle', and 'draw'           │
