│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ grouped_parametrized_crz_entanglement                                                     │
│ patch_description        │ Replace the fixed CZ entangling layer with a modest set of grouped parametrized           │
│                          │ controlled-Z-rotations (CRZ).                                                             │
│                          │ Rationale:                                                                                │
│                          │ - Parametrized two-qubit gates get independent parameter copies for each block            │
│                          │ repetition/upload, so replacing fixed CZs with CRZs allows the entanglement strengths to  │
│                          │ vary across uploads and repeats, effectively producing different entanglement patterns    │
│                          │ per data re-upload without changing the outer training loop.                              │
│                          │ - Grouping multiple physical edges under the same parameter preserves symmetry and keeps  │
│                          │ the per-block parameter count moderate (we group ring edges into 4 shared params and hub  │
│                          │ links into 2 shared params).                                                              │
│                          │ - This yields richer expressive power and diverse mixing pathways while limiting          │
│                          │ parameter explosion and maintaining adjacency constraints.                                │
│                          │ I keep the same compact, symmetry-aware single-qubit layers and final output rotations,   │
│                          │ but substitute the fixed 8 CZs with 12 CRZ gates using 6 grouped parameter keys. Expect   │
│                          │ improved representation and potentially better validation/test accuracy at the cost of a  │
│                          │ controlled increase in parameter count.                                                   │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0124                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
