│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ midrz_shared_crz_mixed                                                                    │
│ patch_description        │ Introduce a lightweight mid-block shared Z-phase layer (periphery vs center) immediately  │
│                          │ after a compact entangler set, and replace the center spokes with a shared parametrized   │
│                          │ CRZ entangler. The block keeps symmetry-aware shared RY initializations and a compact     │
│                          │ shared RX mixing on the periphery to remain parameter-efficient (9 parameters per block,  │
│                          │ unchanged total count). Structural changes:                                               │
│                          │ - Added a shared mid-block RZ pair ("rz_block_periphery", "rz_block_center") to break     │
│                          │ parity and improve expressivity without increasing depth much.                            │
│                          │ - Use fixed CZ ring entanglers on a symmetric subset and shared CRZ on all spokes         │
│                          │ (tunable center coupling) to better capture hub-periphery correlations.                   │
│                          │ - Keep shared periphery parameters for efficiency and reuse "ry_center" as the center     │
│                          │ mixing to reduce parameter count while enabling focused center control.                   │
│                          │ These changes aim to increase representational power where it matters (hub spokes + mid   │
│                          │ Z-phase) while maintaining low parameter count and moderate depth for better              │
│                          │ generalization and faster convergence.                                                    │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0216                                                                                   │
