│                          │ positions (corners, edges, center; periphery vs center output) to remain                  │
│                          │ parameter-efficient. The mixing RX is shared globally to keep the parameter count low     │
│                          │ while promoting wide mixing. This crossover yields the same compact parameterization (9   │
│                          │ unique parameters per block -> 54 total parameters) and merges the effective parametrized │
│                          │ entanglers from the better-performing scripts with the symmetry-aware single-qubit motif  │
│                          │ from the seed. The rest of the program, training loop, feature map, data construction,    │
│                          │ and measurements are unchanged.                                                           │
