│ patch_description        │ Refine the symmetry-aware parameter sharing by splitting the 'periphery' group into       │
│                          │ 'corner' and 'edge' buckets for the RX mixing and RZ phase layers. This distinction is    │
│                          │ motivated by the geometric difference in connectivity and winning line participation      │
│                          │ between corners (3 lines) and edges (2 lines). By using 'rx_corner', 'rx_edge',           │
│                          │ 'rz_corner', and 'rz_edge' instead of a single 'periphery' tag, we increase the model's   │
│                          │ capacity to distinguish spatial features without significantly increasing the total       │
│                          │ parameter count (staying within the 54-60 parameter range).                               │
